# Public Turnstile site key, baked into the prerendered blog pages at
# build time. Not a secret. Create a Turnstile widget for
# modelsindex.dev in the Cloudflare dashboard to get one.
# When unset, the comment form renders with no bot-check widget and
# the server-side check in src/lib/turnstile.ts passes through
# unverified (see .dev.vars.example for the matching secret key).
PUBLIC_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY=
